.astro/
dist/

# Node
node_modules/

# Build-time generated content (re-created by prebuild scripts)
# Only the auto-generated NNNN-*.mdx ADRs are ignored; the hand-authored
# index.mdx (catalogue landing) and ADR data JSONs are tracked.
src/content/docs/adr/[0-9]*.mdx
src/content/docs/adr/[0-9]*.md
src/content/docs/reference/schema.mdx
src/content/docs/developers/database/
src/content/docs/roadmap.mdx
src/data/adrs.json
src/data/phases.json
src/data/schema.json
public/openapi.yaml
# NOTE: src/content/github/snapshot.json is intentionally TRACKED.
# The scheduled GH Actions workflow (.github/workflows/site-github-snapshot.yml)
# refreshes it on cron and commits the update; CF Pages picks it up.
# Local dev: run `pnpm refresh-github` to update against your gh.exe token.

